{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on a <strong>documentary game</strong> that delves into the history of beliefs in devils and <strong>witches</strong>, layering it with contemporary insights. Immerse yourself in the darkness of the Middle Ages at your own pace, and let <i>Lucifer </i>be your guide.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1066740/extras/43bbca2c3e30f7c96de75709709aa9b9.avif?t=1775746242\" width=610 height=128 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The experience is centered on <strong>story and atmosphere</strong>. You will not find difficult choices, action sequences, or inventory management here; movement is limited to progressing through locations along with the plot.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1066740/extras/c9dd46a99f5245cad939ee0be2aaede9.avif?t=1775746242\" width=610 height=128 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the intricate beliefs surrounding <strong>black magic</strong> from diverse perspectives across time and place. Unravel centuries-old occult knowledge, tracing the evolution of <i>fear </i>and fascination across cultures. Immerse yourself in a rich tapestry of historical and geographical contexts, each offering unique insights into the enigmatic world of dark arts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1066740/extras/58ed29ac6c79a9654f9b30aad9c64c0e.avif?t=1775746242\" width=610 height=128 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into a suspenseful story that sheds light on the severe aftermath of blasphemy and the deep fear of <strong>divine consequences</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1066740/extras/d53d2492d8279934db4656d48bbda138.avif?t=1775746242\" width=610 height=128 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you are interested in the concept, you can check out our <strong>FREE</strong> adaptation of H. P. Lovecraft's short story <i>Dagon</i>.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">-- <strong>10% of revenue will be donated to charity organizations</strong> --</h2>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1066740?t=1775746242","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1066740?t=1775746242","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1066740/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1775746242","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1066740/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1775746242","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Tracked Controller Support","id":52},{"description":"VR Supported","id":53},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on a <strong>documentary game</strong> that delves into the history of beliefs in devils and <strong>witches</strong>, layering it with contemporary insights. Immerse yourself in the darkness of the Middle Ages at your own pace, and let <i>Lucifer </i>be your guide.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1066740/extras/43bbca2c3e30f7c96de75709709aa9b9.avif?t=1775746242\" width=610 height=128 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The experience is centered on <strong>story and atmosphere</strong>. You will not find difficult choices, action sequences, or inventory management here; movement is limited to progressing through locations along with the plot.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1066740/extras/c9dd46a99f5245cad939ee0be2aaede9.avif?t=1775746242\" width=610 height=128 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the intricate beliefs surrounding <strong>black magic</strong> from diverse perspectives across time and place. Unravel centuries-old occult knowledge, tracing the evolution of <i>fear </i>and fascination across cultures. Immerse yourself in a rich tapestry of historical and geographical contexts, each offering unique insights into the enigmatic world of dark arts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1066740/extras/58ed29ac6c79a9654f9b30aad9c64c0e.avif?t=1775746242\" width=610 height=128 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into a suspenseful story that sheds light on the severe aftermath of blasphemy and the deep fear of <strong>divine consequences</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1066740/extras/d53d2492d8279934db4656d48bbda138.avif?t=1775746242\" width=610 height=128 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you are interested in the concept, you can check out our <strong>FREE</strong> adaptation of H. P. Lovecraft's short story <i>Dagon</i>.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">-- <strong>10% of revenue will be do